Support -- support for probability distribution
***********************************************

Description
===========

A key in *note ProbabilityDistribution: ProbabilityDistribution, objects and an
option for *note discreteProbabilityDistribution:
discreteProbabilityDistribution, and *note continuousProbabilityDistribution:
continuousProbabilityDistribution, for setting the support of the probability
distribution.

Functions with optional argument named Support:
===============================================

  * "continuousProbabilityDistribution(...,Support=>...)" -- see *note
    continuousProbabilityDistribution: continuousProbabilityDistribution, --
    construct a continuous probability distribution
  * "discreteProbabilityDistribution(...,Support=>...)" -- see *note
    discreteProbabilityDistribution: discreteProbabilityDistribution, --
    construct a discrete probability distribution

For the programmer
==================

The object *note Support: Support, is a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

