|                                      |
|o3 = .9872048016000059                |
|                                      |
|o3 : RR (of precision 53)             |
+--------------------------------------+
|i4 : quantile_X 0.4                   |
|                                      |
|o4 = 1                                |
+--------------------------------------+
|i5 : random X                         |
|                                      |
|o5 = 2                                |
