gammaDistribution -- gamma distribution
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        gammaDistribution(alpha, lambda)
  * Inputs:
      * alpha, a *note number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number,, the shape parameter
        (positive);
      * lambda, a *note number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number,, the rate parameter
        (positive);

Description
===========

The gamma distribution (see https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/gamma_distribution ).
When alpha is an integer (also known as the Erlang distribution (see
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erlang_distribution )), this is waiting time
until the alphath event in a Poisson process where lambda is the expected
number of events in one unit of time.  In particular, when alpha is 1, this is
